00:01:36.793 --> 00:01:41.593
Covered call writing as the Motley Fool laid out, lets you collect premium on shares you

00:01:41.593 --> 00:01:46.513
already own or are willing to buy, capping upside in exchange for yield while you hold

00:01:46.513 --> 00:01:47.053
the position.

00:01:47.713 --> 00:01:52.013
Think of it like taking a non-refundable deposit on a holiday cottage you still want to

00:01:52.013 --> 00:01:52.313
own.

00:01:52.813 --> 00:01:57.393
You keep the deposit if the week passes quietly, but if a buyer shows up at your posted

00:01:57.393 --> 00:02:03.013
price you hand over the keys. CrowdStrike Rose on Appears Strong Earnings Report, even as the

00:02:03.013 --> 00:02:08.093
broader market fell, creating a setup where an investor comfortable owning the name could sell calls

00:02:08.093 --> 00:02:14.393
against it. To implement, screened for liquid options chains on U.S. listed tech names, select the

00:02:14.393 --> 00:02:20.493
nearest monthly expiry, and sell the out-of-the-money call whose premium equals roughly 1% of the underlying

00:02:20.493 --> 00:02:26.453
price. Canadian investors can execute this inside a tax-free savings account, or TFSA,

00:02:26.453 --> 00:02:33.673
or a registered retirement savings plan or RRSP through any broker offering U.S. options such as

00:02:33.673 --> 00:02:38.713
interactive brokers or quest trade and I have no financial relationship with interactive brokers,

00:02:38.973 --> 00:02:44.593
quest trade, wealth simple or Bloomberg by first confirming the name meets the five session hold

00:02:44.593 --> 00:02:50.173
criteria and then writing the call on the same day as the share purchase. The approach has delivered

00:02:50.173 --> 00:02:56.073
positive alpha in the record when volume confirmation was present and it has lagged when sector rotation

00:02:56.073 --> 00:03:01.033
accelerated without that confirmation. When the peer earnings catalyst is confirmed and

00:03:01.033 --> 00:03:05.553
the broader index is declining, the premium provides a buffer that improves the matched

00:03:05.553 --> 00:03:10.933
window outcome versus simply holding shares. The risk is early assignment or a sharp rally

00:03:10.933 --> 00:03:15.973
that leaves the shares called away above the strike, and the technique fails when the invalidation

00:03:15.973 --> 00:03:21.393
fires inside the window, such as negative revisions from the same peer group that originally lifted

00:03:21.393 --> 00:03:27.353
the sector. Remember, write the call the same day you buy the shares. Delay is how the premium walks

00:03:27.353 --> 00:03:34.756
away. Crowdstrike holdings ticker CRWD is today's simulated weekly hold, and this is a simulated

00:03:34.756 --> 00:03:40.516
trade for learning purposes with no real money involved. You see a cybersecurity name holding up on

